re the protagonist is held."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a very strong-willed woman, but she is awakened to masochistic pleasure by the protagonist. She is not a fussy woman, but she is a woman with a brutal atmospher and is feared by the guards."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and the protagonist are usually equals, but during sexual intercourse, they take on a master slave relationship."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her attitude toward women is the same as the protagonist's, and she only thinks about torturing them. She likes to be raped herself, but she also likes to torture women and watch them be tortured."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From DLsite"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30749"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に飼い慣らされている男囚監房の所長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"超気が強い女性だったが、主人公によってマゾの快感に目覚めさせられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"残忍な雰囲気が漂い、看守たちからも恐れられる存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは日頃は対等な関係だが、セックスの時は主従の関係になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じく女性を責め嬲ることに悦びを感じるが、自身も***されることも同等なくらいに好き。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26165","sourceWorkId":"6472","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に飼い慣らされている男囚監房の所長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"超が付くほどの気の強い女性だが、主人公にマゾの快感を目覚めさせられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気が強いと言ってもやたらと騒ぎ立てる様な感じではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"残忍な雰囲気の漂うキャラクターで、看守達からも恐れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは日頃は対等な関係だが、性交の時には主従の関係になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性に対する態度は主人公と同じで、ひたすら責め嬲る事しか考えない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身が犯される事も好きだが、それと同じくらい女を責めたりその様子を見るのも好き。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"220108"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"120 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26165","sourceWorkId":"6472","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"182 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26165","sourceWorkId":"6472","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"110 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2